(7552010, 1210028, 163081, '<td valign="top">Clever to flip your picture upside down. It becomes something out of this world. In my top 3. A 9 from me and my Red Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Clever to flip your picture upside down. It becomes something out of this world. In my top 3. A 9 from me and my Red Dragon Award', '2018-01-10 13:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552011, 1210016, 163081, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Without your title I could see and feel things in that picture. With your given title, .... it''s exactly that what I feel.<br/>My highest vote (10) and my Blue Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173261" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Nice abstract. Without your title I could see and feel things in that picture. With your given title, .... it''s exactly that what I feel.My highest vote (10) and my Blue Dragon Award', '2018-01-10 13:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
