(7552207, 1209877, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely! One of my picks for a ribbon.</td>', 'Lovely! One of my picks for a ribbon.', '2018-01-11 21:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552246, 1210026, 94815, '<td valign="top">Down and dirty natural abstract the way it should be.</td>', 'Down and dirty natural abstract the way it should be.', '2018-01-11 22:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552248, 1209968, 94815, '<td valign="top">Could easily be an abstract expressionist painting like hints of early Pollack.</td>', 'Could easily be an abstract expressionist painting like hints of early Pollack.', '2018-01-11 22:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552249, 1209995, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good abstract as in: I don''t know why anyone would paint this except to satisfy some abstract impulse. In my top three.</td>', 'Good abstract as in: I don''t know why anyone would paint this except to satisfy some abstract impulse. In my top three.', '2018-01-11 22:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552251, 1210009, 94815, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t remind me of either of the named painters but the image is very evocative of early Rauschenberg''s technique. Anyway its in my top three..</td>', 'Doesn''t remind me of either of the named painters but the image is very evocative of early Rauschenberg''s technique. Anyway its in my top three..', '2018-01-11 22:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552252, 1210005, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good strong contrast lets the viewer conjure up faces among the random meanderings in the image.</td>', 'Good strong contrast lets the viewer conjure up faces among the random meanderings in the image.', '2018-01-11 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552253, 1209965, 94815, '<td valign="top">Almost passed this up as not abstract, but then the random abstractions popped out and stuck. Very enticing image to ruminate about,</td>', 'Almost passed this up as not abstract, but then the random abstractions popped out and stuck. Very enticing image to ruminate about,', '2018-01-11 22:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552254, 1209601, 94815, '<td valign="top">My favorite. The delicate lines have a sensuous quality against the earthy background that has a ninja quality of sneaking up on one''s consciousness.<br/>Did you see that by rotating 90 deg. closkwise it becomes a Picasso-like, synthetic cubist line drawing of a woman?</td>', 'My favorite. The delicate lines have a sensuous quality against the earthy background that has a ninja quality of sneaking up on one''s consciousness.Did you see that by rotating 90 deg. closkwise it becomes a Picasso-like, synthetic cubist line drawing of a woman?', '2018-01-11 22:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552263, 1210026, 173844, '<td valign="top">Took a while to appreciate this unusual image.  When you back up and squint the blocks of tone fall into an uneasy balance.  To me the dark blotch resembles a person facing left with a release of white liquid -  don''t know what that is  - flowing onto or into the figure''s head.  That''s the abstraction, mysteriously suggestive, which engages the viewer.  Don''t know if I''m onto something or not.  But the staying power of this photo is wrapped up in its abstract opacity and ambiguity.</td>', 'Took a while to appreciate this unusual image.  When you back up and squint the blocks of tone fall into an uneasy balance.  To me the dark blotch resembles a person facing left with a release of white liquid -  don''t know what that is  - flowing onto or into the figure''s head.  That''s the abstraction, mysteriously suggestive, which engages the viewer.  Don''t know if I''m onto something or not.  But the staying power of this photo is wrapped up in its abstract opacity and ambiguity.', '2018-01-11 23:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552266, 1210020, 173844, '<td valign="top">First appreciated as surf flowing on a beach, later as snow on a sidewalk, it''s still a fine piece of work.  The raggedness of the yin/yang (assuming that ying is meant to be yin) hews more realistically to how the world works, irregular and not clear cut, and it''s an interesting take.  The textures and grain also hold interest.  The composition is good.  Nice image.</td>', 'First appreciated as surf flowing on a beach, later as snow on a sidewalk, it''s still a fine piece of work.  The raggedness of the yin/yang (assuming that ying is meant to be yin) hews more realistically to how the world works, irregular and not clear cut, and it''s an interesting take.  The textures and grain also hold interest.  The composition is good.  Nice image.', '2018-01-11 23:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552267, 1209972, 173844, '<td valign="top">Intricate composition in service of a mechanized, industrial abstract.  Fine tones and contrast.  The title is "Noir," but it seems brighter to me, almost upbeat, but that''s just my take.  It''s visually very appealing.</td>', 'Intricate composition in service of a mechanized, industrial abstract.  Fine tones and contrast.  The title is "Noir," but it seems brighter to me, almost upbeat, but that''s just my take.  It''s visually very appealing.', '2018-01-11 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552268, 1210028, 173844, '<td valign="top">Peculiarly magical, then you see that it''s an upside down scene.  Seems more surreal than abstract, but it''s still vastly engaging.  I especially like the ocean as sky.  One of the more vivid images in the challenge.</td>', 'Peculiarly magical, then you see that it''s an upside down scene.  Seems more surreal than abstract, but it''s still vastly engaging.  I especially like the ocean as sky.  One of the more vivid images in the challenge.', '2018-01-11 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552269, 1209921, 173844, '<td valign="top">Now here''s an abstract, spaces and lines, weight and counterweight, comprising an image of delicate and whimsical composition.  This would look great shown at twenty feet long centered on large museum wall.</td>', 'Now here''s an abstract, spaces and lines, weight and counterweight, comprising an image of delicate and whimsical composition.  This would look great shown at twenty feet long centered on large museum wall.', '2018-01-11 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552270, 1210005, 173844, '<td valign="top">So much incredible reflections and swirls to be seen in water, an endless play of light and shifting contour.  The is a wonderful image of the phenomenon.  As a matter of fact, this is what the water might look like under the bridge in Munch''s "The Scream".  Great interplay of dark and light.</td>', 'So much incredible reflections and swirls to be seen in water, an endless play of light and shifting contour.  The is a wonderful image of the phenomenon.  As a matter of fact, this is what the water might look like under the bridge in Munch''s "The Scream".  Great interplay of dark and light.', '2018-01-11 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552272, 1209516, 173844, '<td valign="top">Precise graphic image that seems to float in space despite the hefty mass of the geometrical solids.  Wonderfully, the central block can shift back and forth, facing right and left, as you shift your perception.  Looks like a simple abstract, but it''s quite enterprising in its cunning and composition.</td>', 'Precise graphic image that seems to float in space despite the hefty mass of the geometrical solids.  Wonderfully, the central block can shift back and forth, facing right and left, as you shift your perception.  Looks like a simple abstract, but it''s quite enterprising in its cunning and composition.', '2018-01-11 23:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
